---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Ashmit Bohora Resume | UT Austin Data Science, Software & AI"
  description="Resume of Ashmit Bohora, a UT Austin Statistics & Data Science student (Class of 2029): Growth Engineer at WLF Club, founder of Webspansion and Prospansion, creator of BohoBites, builder of Warvis and Guruji."
>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  <header class="site">
    <div class="wrap masthead">
      <a class="title" href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">Ashmit <span>Bohora</span></a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mainNav">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
      <nav aria-label="Main" id="mainNav">
        <div class="nav-sections">
          <a href="/">Full site</a>
          <a href="/#shipped">Shipped</a>
          <a href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PDF version</a>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-icons">
          <a href="https://github.com/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.3C4.3 1.3 1.3 4.3 1.3 8c0 3 1.9 5.4 4.5 6.3.3.1.5-.1.5-.4v-1.4c-1.8.4-2.2-.8-2.2-.8-.3-.8-.7-1-.7-1-.6-.4.1-.4.1-.4.6 0 1 .6 1 .6.6 1 1.5.7 1.9.5.1-.4.2-.7.4-.9-1.5-.2-3-.7-3-3.3 0-.7.3-1.3.6-1.8-.1-.2-.3-.9.1-1.8 0 0 .5-.2 1.7.6.5-.1 1-.2 1.5-.2s1 .1 1.5.2c1.2-.8 1.7-.6 1.7-.6.4.9.1 1.6.1 1.8.4.5.6 1.1.6 1.8 0 2.6-1.5 3.1-3 3.3.2.2.4.5.4 1.1v1.6c0 .3.2.5.5.4 2.6-.9 4.5-3.3 4.5-6.3 0-3.7-3-6.7-6.7-6.7z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.3" y="1.3" width="13.4" height="13.4" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="5" cy="5.2" r="0.9" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M5 7.3v4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M8 11.5V8.8c0-1 .7-1.6 1.6-1.6.9 0 1.4.6 1.4 1.6v2.7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M8 7.3v4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="wrap resume-head">
      <h1>Ashmit Bohora <span class="lit">Resume</span></h1>
      <p class="resume-dek">
        UT Austin Statistics &amp; Data Science, Class of 2029. Seeking Summer 2027 internships in
        data analytics, marketing analytics, growth, and data science. The same one-pager recruiters
        get, as a real page.
      </p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download PDF</a>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:ashmitbohora@utexas.edu">Email me</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="sheet" aria-label="Resume of Ashmit Bohora">
        <header class="sheet-head">
          <p class="sheet-name">Ashmit Bohora</p>
          <p class="sheet-contact">
            Austin, TX &middot; <a href="mailto:ashmitbohora@utexas.edu">ashmitbohora@utexas.edu</a>
            &middot; <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora</a>
            &middot; <a href="https://github.com/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/ashmitbohora</a>
            &middot; <a href="/">ashmitbohora.com</a>
          </p>
          <p class="sheet-tagline">Statistics &amp; Data Science sophomore who builds the software and owns the marketing it feeds: analytics stacks, CRM attribution, growth automation, and the content on top</p>
        </header>

        <h2>Education</h2>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">The University of Texas at Austin <span class="sub">&middot; B.S. Statistics and Data Science</span></span>
            <span class="meta">Expected May 2029 &middot; GPA 3.75/4.0</span>
          </div>
          <p class="honors">QuestBridge Finalist (2024) &middot; UT Austin Impact Scholar ($48,000 merit award) &middot; Merner Scholarship in Natural Sciences ($2,000, 2026&ndash;27)</p>
          <p class="honors">Coursework: Probability &amp; Statistical Inference, Linear Algebra, Elements of Software Design (Fall 2026) &middot; Intro to Data Science, Statistical Thinking, Multivariable Calculus</p>
        </section>

        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">Growth Engineer <span class="sub">&middot; WLF Club (chiropractic &amp; longevity clinic)</span></span>
            <span class="meta">Fort Worth, TX &rarr; Remote (Austin) &middot; May 2026 &ndash; Present</span>
          </div>
          <p class="honors">Owns the online side: analytics, tracking, website, CRM automation, reporting (contract, 1099)</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Stood up the clinic&rsquo;s measurement stack from zero: GA4, Meta Pixel, Microsoft Clarity, and a privacy-gated first-party tracker on every page (8,597 human events and 567 durable visitor IDs in the first weeks), then an identity-resolution layer that matches anonymous visitors to named CRM contacts through a GoHighLevel webhook, verified end to end in production</li>
            <li>Analyzed 780+ CRM sales opportunities and found 95% never reached a decision despite a 92% win rate when worked; reframed the growth plan from &ldquo;buy more ads&rdquo; to working the existing backlog</li>
            <li>Rebuilt wlfclub.com in-house, replacing a $15,000 agency build that had 12 Lorem Ipsum pages live: 31 pages, JSON-LD on every page, a 121-rule redirect map with zero broken targets, and a zero-downtime DNS cutover to Cloudflare (a 3,217-contact email send delivered at 99.74% the same day)</li>
            <li>Cut homepage weight from 2,027 KB to 814 KB (mobile Lighthouse 68 to 91); ran the first paid Meta campaign, diagnosed a 51% sub-3-second bounce on a 1.78 MB landing page, and paused spend until the page was fixed</li>
            <li>Built Warvis, the team&rsquo;s internal AI assistant (retrieval over 391 business notes, HIPAA-aware PHI-scanning gate, 610 passing tests, hosted at ~$12/mo) and its weekly Data Room, which pulls appointments, invoices, and lead sources straight from the GoHighLevel API so the owner reads live numbers instead of a spreadsheet</li>
            <li>Shipped an AI front-desk chat on every page, red-teamed it with 20 hostile prompts and fixed 7 defects; built a member health portal (Cloudflare Workers + D1) with WHOOP/Apple Health sync and a 17-marker labs engine to replace paid software</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">Webspansion &amp; Prospansion <span class="sub">&middot; Founder</span></span>
            <span class="meta">Euless, TX / Austin, TX &middot; Dec 2023 &ndash; Present</span>
          </div>
          <p class="honors">Free web studio for small businesses and nonprofits, plus a paid build arm</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Shipped 19 live websites solo (intake, scope, build, deploy, handoff) for immigrant-owned businesses, nonprofits, and student groups; closed the first paid build ($999) in Aug 2026</li>
            <li>Built a cookieless first-party analytics platform (Cloudflare Workers + D1) that now tracks 27 client domains; ran the studio&rsquo;s own growth with 23+ SEO-optimized posts, 8 case studies, 118 UTM-tagged outbound links, and per-page Open Graph cards generated by a Python pipeline</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="block">
          <div class="row">
            <span class="role">BohoBites <span class="sub">&middot; Founder &amp; Creator (TikTok food reviews, DFW &amp; Austin)</span></span>
            <span class="meta">2025 &ndash; Present</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Grew the account to 7.2K followers and 122K likes across 67 posts, with a top video at 558K views; built the analytics pipeline in Python (pandas, Plotly, Shiny) with rolling 30&ndash;365 day KPI windows and posting-time models, and a pitch page per inbound restaurant with live view counts</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <section class="block">
          <ul>
            <li><span class="k">Retrieval systems, built three times:</span> Warvis for WLF (above); a bilingual English/Nepali family assistant at family.ashmitbohora.com (Cloudflare Worker, signed-cookie auth, rate-limited); and BoHub, a local knowledge OS that indexes 1,000+ markdown notes into SQLite FTS5 with tiered Claude API routing</li>
            <li><span class="k">Guruji (<a href="https://getguruji.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">getguruji.com</a>):</span> free, gamified community-education web app (React, TypeScript, Supabase) with row-level-security auth and an AA-verified UI</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <h2>Skills &amp; Leadership</h2>
        <section class="block skills">
          <p><span class="k">Analytics &amp; growth:</span> SQL, GA4, Microsoft Clarity, Meta Pixel &amp; Ads, Google Ads, GoHighLevel CRM, UTM attribution, identity resolution, SEO &amp; schema markup, Core Web Vitals</p>
          <p><span class="k">Languages &amp; data:</span> Python (pandas, NumPy, Plotly, Shiny), R, SQL, TypeScript/JavaScript &middot; PostgreSQL (Supabase), SQLite/D1</p>
          <p><span class="k">Web &amp; AI:</span> React, Next.js, Astro, Cloudflare Workers, Vercel &middot; Claude Code, Claude &amp; Gemini APIs, RAG &middot; Git, Playwright</p>
          <p><span class="k">Leadership:</span> Director of Social, Nepalese Student Association at UT (2026&ndash;) &middot; DFW &amp; NST Mandir youth programs (2021&ndash;): co-led fundraising of $10,000+, ran logistics for health camps and blood drives</p>
          <p><span class="k">Spoken:</span> English, Nepali (fluent); Hindi, Spanish (intermediate)</p>
        </section>
      </article>

      <div class="sheet-foot">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download Ashmit Bohora's resume as a PDF</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/">See the full portfolio</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="sig">Chef &amp; engineer: <span>Ashmit Bohora</span>, Austin TX</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="https://github.com/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a href="/ashmit-bohora-resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resume PDF</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashmitbohora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="mailto:ashmitbohora@utexas.edu">Email</a>
        <a href="/#brands">Social Media</a>
      </div>
      <p class="fineprint">Every line on this page is measured, not garnished.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const navToggle = document.getElementById('navToggle') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const mainNav = document.getElementById('mainNav')!;
    navToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const open = mainNav.classList.toggle('open');
      navToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    });
  </script>
</Base>

<style>
  .resume-head {
    padding-block: 56px 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .resume-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .resume-dek {
    margin: 16px auto 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .resume-head .cta {
    margin-top: 24px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .sheet {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 2.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink);
    padding: clamp(24px, 4.5vw, 48px);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .sheet-name {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .sheet-contact {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .sheet-contact a {
    color: var(--ketchup);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mustard);
  }
  .sheet-contact a:hover { border-color: var(--ketchup); }
  .sheet-tagline {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .sheet-head { padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ketchup); }

  .sheet h2 {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ketchup);
    margin: 26px 0 10px;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #e2d6bc;
  }
  .block { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .role { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .role .sub { font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .meta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tech {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .sheet ul { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; }
  .sheet li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
    margin: 6px 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .sheet li::before {
    content: "\00b7";
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    color: var(--ketchup);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .sheet li a, .also a {
    color: var(--ketchup);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mustard);
  }
  .sheet li a:hover, .also a:hover { border-color: var(--ketchup); }
  .honors { color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 6px; font-size: 15px; }
  .also { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
  .k { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .skills p { margin: 7px 0; }

  .sheet-foot {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 30px auto 80px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .meta { white-space: normal; }
  }
</style>
